             \"name\": \"Central AC Maintenance\",\r\n              \"serviceType\": \"Central Air Conditioning Maintenance\",\r\n              \"description\": \"Preventive maintenance and annual check-ups to improve efficiency and extend the life of your central AC unit.\"\r\n            }\r\n          }\r\n        ]\r\n      }\r\n    }\r\n    </script>\r\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">\r\n    {\r\n        \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\r\n        \"@type\": \"WebPage\",\r\n        \"url\": \"https://atlasaircons.com/central-ac-installation-repair-service\",\r\n        \"name\": \"Expert Central AC Installation & Repair in Vadodara | Atlas Aircon\",\r\n        \"description\": \"Top-rated central AC installation, repair, and maintenance services in Vadodara. Atlas Aircon offers emergency repairs, gas refilling, and troubleshooting for all major brands. Get a free quote today!\",\r\n        \"mainEntity\": {\r\n            \"@type\": \"Article\",\r\n            \"headline\": \"Expert Central AC Installation and Repair Services in Vadodara by Atlas Aircon\",\r\n            \"author\": {\r\n                \"@type\": \"Organization\",\r\n                \"name\": \"Atlas Aircon\"\r\n            },\r\n            \"publisher\": {\r\n                \"@type\": \"Organization\",\r\n                \"name\": \"Atlas Aircon\",\r\n                \"logo\": {\r\n                    \"@type\": \"ImageObject\",\r\n                    \"url\": \"https://atlasaircons.com/path/to/logo.png\"\r\n                }\r\n            },\r\n            \"datePublished\": \"2025-09-19\"\r\n        }\r\n    }\r\n    </script>\r\n\r\n<!-- Main Content -->\r\n\r\n<main>\r\n<!-- Hero Section --></main><section class=\"hero-bg text-white\">\r\n<div class=\"container mx-auto px-6 py-24 md:py-32 text-center\">\r\n<h1 class=\"text-4xl md:text-6xl font-extrabold leading-tight mb-4\">Expert Central AC Installation Repair Services in Vadodara</h1>\r\n<p class=\"text-lg md:text-xl max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-8 text-gray-200\">Your trusted partner for reliable, efficient, and affordable central air conditioning solutions. Keep your home and business comfortable all year round by best central ac installation repair service in vadodara.</p>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-4\"><a class=\"bg-orange-500 text-white font-bold py-3 px-8 rounded-lg text-lg hover:bg-orange-600 transition-colors duration-300 shadow-lg\" href=\"https://share.google/N8mhaAsoZnKCf3osH\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Get a Free Quote Now</a>\r\n<a class=\"bg-transparent border-2 border-white text-white font-bold py-3 px-8 rounded-lg text-lg hover:bg-white hover:text-blue-800 transition-colors duration-300 shadow-lg\" href=\"#pricing\">View Price List</a></div>\r\n</div>\r\n</section><!-- Key Features Section -->\r\n\r\n<section class=\"py-12 bg-white\">\r\n<div class=\"container mx-auto px-6\">\r\n<div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-8 text-center\">\r\n<div class=\"p-4\">\r\n<h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-blue-700\">24/7 Emergency Central Ac Installation Repair Service</h3>\r\n<p class=\"text-gray-600\">Available round-the-clock for urgent repairs.</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"p-4\">\r\n<h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-blue-700\">Certified Technicians</h3>\r\n<p class=\"text-gray-600\">Licensed, insured, and highly trained professionals.</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"p-4\">\r\n<h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-blue-700\">Upfront Pricing</h3>\r\n<p class=\"text-gray-600\">Transparent costs with no hidden fees.</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"p-4\">\r\n<h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-blue-700\">Satisfaction Guaranteed</h3>\r\n<p class=\"text-gray-600\">We stand by the quality of our workmanship.</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</section><!-- Introduction Section -->\r\n\r\n<section class=\"py-16\">\r\n<div class=\"container mx-auto px-6 text-center\">\r\n<h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4\">Your Comfort is Our Priority</h2>\r\n<p class=\"max-w-4xl mx-auto text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\">During Vadodara&#8217;s scorching summers, a <strong>reliable central AC system</strong> isn&#8217;t a luxury—it&#8217;s a necessity. At Atlas Aircon, we specialize in providing comprehensive <strong>central AC installation and repair services</strong> to ensure your environment remains cool and comfortable. Our certified HVAC technicians leverage cutting-edge technology to diagnose and resolve any issue, from minor troubleshooting to complete system upgrades. Whether you need a brand new <strong>energy-efficient central AC</strong> unit or urgent repairs on your existing system, we deliver prompt, professional service every time.</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</section><!-- \"WooCommerce-Style\" Services Section -->\r\n\r\n<section id=\"services\" class=\"py-16 bg-white\">\r\n<div class=\"container mx-auto px-6\">\r\n<div class=\"text-center mb-12\">\r\n<h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-extrabold text-gray-900\">Our Core Central AC Services</h2>\r\n<p class=\"text-gray-600 mt-2 max-w-2xl mx-auto\">We handle every aspect of your central air conditioning system with precision and care.</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-8\">\r\n\r\n<!-- Service Card 1 -->\r\n<div class=\"service-card bg-white rounded-lg shadow-lg overflow-hidden text-center\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://atlasaircons.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/emergency-ac-repair-in-vadodara.webp\" alt=\"Central AC Installation Repair Service - Field Operations\" title=\"\"> alt=&#8221;Emergency central AC repair service in Vadodara&#8221;\r\nclass=&#8221;w-full h-48 object-cover&#8221;\r\nonerror=&#8221;this.onerror=null; this.outerHTML = `\r\n<div class=\"w-full h-48 bg-gray-200 flex items-center justify-center\"></div>\r\n`&#8221;&gt;\r\n<div class=\"p-6\">\r\n<h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold mb-2\">Emergency AC Repair</h3>\r\n<p class=\"text-gray-600 mb-4\">Fast, 24/7 response for unexpected breakdowns to restore your comfort quickly.</p>\r\n<a rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"bg-blue-600 text-white font-bold py-2 px-4 rounded-lg w-full inline-block hover:bg-blue-700 transition-colors duration-300\" href=\"https://atlasaircons.com/ac-repair-in-vadodara.html\">Book Now</a>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<!-- Service Card 2 -->\r\n<div class=\"service-card bg-white rounded-lg shadow-lg overflow-hidden text-center\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://atlasaircons.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/ac-repair-service.webp\" alt=\"Central AC Installation Repair Service - Field Operations\" title=\"\"> alt=&#8221;Technician performing comprehensive central AC repair&#8221;\r\nclass=&#8221;w-full h-48 object-cover&#8221;\r\nonerror=&#8221;this.onerror=null; this.outerHTML = `\r\n<div class=\"w-full h-48 bg-gray-200 flex items-center justify-center\"></div>\r\n`&#8221;&gt;\r\n<div class=\"p-6\">\r\n<h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold mb-2\">Component Repair</h3>\r\n<p class=\"text-gray-600 mb-4\">Expert repair of compressors, fan motors, cooling coils, and more.</p>\r\n<a class=\"bg-blue-600 text-white font-bold py-2 px-4 rounded-lg w-full inline-block hover:bg-blue-700 transition-colors duration-300\" href=\"#contact\">Get Diagnosis</a>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<!-- Service Card 3 -->\r\n<div class=\"service-card bg-white rounded-lg shadow-lg overflow-hidden text-center\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://atlasaircons.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/advance-panel-ac-repair-service.webp\" alt=\"Central AC Installation Repair Service - Field Operations\" title=\"\"> alt=&#8221;Advanced PCB circuit repair for central AC unit&#8221;\r\nclass=&#8221;w-full h-48 object-cover&#8221;\r\nonerror=&#8221;this.onerror=null; this.outerHTML = `\r\n<div class=\"w-full h-48 bg-gray-200 flex items-center justify-center\"></div>\r\n`&#8221;&gt;\r\n<div class=\"p-6\">\r\n<h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold mb-2\">New AC Installation</h3>\r\n<p class=\"text-gray-600 mb-4\">Professional installation of energy-efficient central AC systems for homes &amp; businesses.</p>\r\n<a class=\"bg-blue-600 text-white font-bold py-2 px-4 rounded-lg w-full inline-block hover:bg-blue-700 transition-colors duration-300\" href=\"#contact\">Plan Installation</a>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<!-- Service Card 4 -->\r\n<div class=\"service-card bg-white rounded-lg shadow-lg overflow-hidden text-center\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://atlasaircons.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/AC-Chemical-Wash-Deep-Cleaning-in-Vadodara.webp\" alt=\"Central AC Installation Repair Service - Field Operations\" title=\"\"> alt=&#8221;Central AC deep cleaning and chemical wash service&#8221;\r\nclass=&#8221;w-full h-48 object-cover&#8221;\r\nonerror=&#8221;this.onerror=null; this.outerHTML = `\r\n<div class=\"w-full h-48 bg-gray-200 flex items-center justify-center\"></div>\r\n`&#8221;&gt;\r\n<div class=\"p-6\">\r\n<h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold mb-2\">Preventive Maintenance</h3>\r\n<p class=\"text-gray-600 mb-4\">Scheduled check-ups, cleaning, and <a rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://atlasaircons.com/affordable-and-expert-ac-repair-service/\">gas refilling</a> to boost efficiency.</p>\r\n<a class=\"bg-blue-600 text-white font-bold py-2 px-4 rounded-lg w-full inline-block hover:bg-blue-700 transition-colors duration-300\" href=\"#contact\">Schedule Check-up</a>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</section><!-- Pricing Section -->\r\n\r\n<section id=\"pricing\" class=\"py-16\">\r\n<div class=\"container mx-auto px-6\">\r\n<div class=\"text-center mb-12\">\r\n<h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-extrabold text-gray-900\">Transparent Service Pricing</h2>\r\n<p class=\"text-gray-600 mt-2 max-w-2xl mx-auto\">Clear, upfront costs for our most common services. No surprises.</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"max-w-4xl mx-auto bg-white rounded-lg shadow-lg overflow-hidden\">\r\n<div class=\"overflow-x-auto\">\r\n<table class=\"w-full text-left\">\r\n<thead class=\"bg-gray-100\">\r\n<tr>\r\n<th class=\"p-4 font-bold\">Service</th>\r\n<th class=\"p-4 font-bold\">Description</th>\r\n<th class=\"p-4 font-bold text-right\">Estimated Cost</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b\">\r\n<td class=\"p-4 font-semibold\">Standard Maintenance / Tune-up</td>\r\n<td class=\"p-4 text-gray-600\">Comprehensive inspection, cleaning of coils, filter check, and system test.</td>\r\n<td class=\"p-4 text-right font-medium\">₹1,499 &#8211; ₹2,500</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b bg-gray-50\">\r\n<td class=\"p-4 font-semibold\">Refrigerant (Gas) Refilling</td>\r\n<td class=\"p-4 text-gray-600\">Leak detection and refilling refrigerant to optimal levels (price varies by type).</td>\r\n<td class=\"p-4 text-right font-medium\">₹2,000 &#8211; ₹5,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b\">\r\n<td class=\"p-4 font-semibold\">Fan Motor Replacement</td>\r\n<td class=\"p-4 text-gray-600\">Includes part and labor for replacing a faulty condenser or blower fan motor.</td>\r\n<td class=\"p-4 text-right font-medium\">₹3,500 &#8211; ₹7,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b bg-gray-50\">\r\n<td class=\"p-4 font-semibold\">Capacitor Replacement</td>\r\n<td class=\"p-4 text-gray-600\">Replacing a failed run or start capacitor to fix starting issues.</td>\r\n<td class=\"p-4 text-right font-medium\">₹1,500 &#8211; ₹3,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td class=\"p-4 font-semibold\">Compressor Repair / Replacement</td>\r\n<td class=\"p-4 text-gray-600\">Diagnosis and repair of the AC compressor. Replacement is quoted on-site.</td>\r\n<td class=\"p-4 text-right font-medium\">Contact for Quote</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p class=\"text-center mt-4 text-sm text-gray-500\">*All prices are estimates and subject to change based on the specific model, issue complexity, and parts required. Final price will be provided after diagnosis.</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</section><!-- Detailed Services / Why Choose Us -->\r\n\r\n<section class=\"py-16 bg-white\">\r\n<div class=\"container mx-auto px-6\">\r\n<div class=\"flex flex-wrap -mx-4 items-center\">\r\n<div class=\"w-full lg:w-1/2 px-4 mb-8 lg:mb-0\">\r\n<h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4\">We Repair It All, Big or Small</h2>\r\n<p class=\"text-gray-600 mb-4 leading-relaxed\">A central air conditioner is a complex system. A problem with one part can affect the entire unit. Our team is trained to handle every component, including:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul class=\"list-disc list-inside text-gray-600 space-y-3\">\r\n \t<li><strong>Compressor &amp; Condenser Coils:</strong> The heart of your AC, we fix and maintain them for optimal cooling.</li>\r\n \t<li><strong>Fan Motors &amp; Blades:</strong> Ensuring proper airflow is crucial for efficiency. We repair and replace faulty fans.</li>\r\n \t<li><strong>PCB Circuit &amp; Remote Controls:</strong> We resolve electrical issues that control your system&#8217;s brain.</li>\r\n \t<li><strong>Refrigerant &amp; Gas Refilling:</strong> We safely handle refrigerant leaks and perform gas refilling to restore cooling power.</li>\r\n \t<li><strong>Ductwork &amp; Air Filters:</strong> We offer cleaning and maintenance for better indoor air quality and performance.</li>\r\n \t<li><strong>Thermostat Issues:</strong> Repairing or upgrading thermostats for accurate temperature control.</li>\r\n \t<li><strong>Drainage Problems:</strong> Clearing clogged condensate drain lines to prevent water damage.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p class=\"mt-4 text-gray-600\">We also offer other expert <a rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"text-blue-600 hover:underline font-semibold\" href=\"https://atlasaircons.com/services/other-repairing/hvac-system-services.html\">HVAC system services</a>, including <a rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"text-blue-600 hover:underline font-semibold\" href=\"https://atlasaircons.com/services/other-repairing/chiller-repair-services.html\">chiller repair services</a> for commercial clients.</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"w-full lg:w-1/2 px-4\">\r\n<div class=\"bg-gray-100 p-8 rounded-lg\">\r\n<h3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold mb-4\">The Atlas Aircon Advantage</h3>\r\n<div class=\"space-y-4\">\r\n<div class=\"flex items-start\">\r\n<div><strong>Experienced Technicians:</strong> Our licensed team has years of hands-on experience with all major AC brands.</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"flex items-start\">\r\n<div><strong>Affordable &amp; Transparent Pricing:</strong> We provide clear, upfront quotes with no hidden fees. Quality service doesn&#8217;t have to break the bank.</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"flex items-start\">\r\n<div><strong>Quality Parts &amp; Warranty:</strong> We use only high-quality, genuine parts for lasting repairs, backed by a service warranty.</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"flex items-start\">\r\n<div><strong>Customer Satisfaction Guaranteed:</strong> We&#8217;re not happy until you&#8217;re cool and comfortable. Your satisfaction is our top priority.</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</section><!-- FAQ Section -->\r\n\r\n<section id=\"faq\" class=\"py-16\">\r\n<div class=\"container mx-auto px-6 max-w-4xl\">\r\n<div class=\"text-center mb-12\">\r\n<h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-extrabold text-gray-900\">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>\r\n<p class=\"text-gray-600 mt-2\">Answers to common questions about our central AC services.</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"space-y-4\">\r\n\r\n<!-- FAQ Item 1 -->\r\n<div class=\"bg-white rounded-lg shadow-md\">\r\n<h3 class=\"font-semibold text-lg\">How much does a new central AC installation cost in Vadodara?</h3>\r\n&nbsp;\r\n<div class=\"accordion-content px-6 pb-6\">\r\n<p class=\"text-gray-600\">The <strong>central AC installation cost</strong> varies based on the size of your property, the brand and model of the unit, and the complexity of the ductwork. We provide a free, no-obligation site survey and a detailed quote tailored to your specific needs.</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<!-- FAQ Item 2 -->\r\n<div class=\"bg-white rounded-lg shadow-md\">\r\n<h3 class=\"font-semibold text-lg\">What are common signs my central AC needs repair?</h3>\r\n&nbsp;\r\n<div class=\"accordion-content px-6 pb-6\">\r\n<p class=\"text-gray-600\">Look out for signs like weak airflow, the unit blowing warm air, strange noises (grinding, squealing), unpleasant odors, frequent cycling on and off, or a sudden increase in your electricity bill. If you notice any of these, it&#8217;s best to call us for a diagnosis.</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<!-- FAQ Item 3 -->\r\n<div class=\"bg-white rounded-lg shadow-md\">\r\n<h3 class=\"font-semibold text-lg\">Is it better to repair or replace my old central AC unit?</h3>\r\n&nbsp;\r\n<div class=\"accordion-content px-6 pb-6\">\r\n<p class=\"text-gray-600\">This depends on a few factors. If your AC is over 10-15 years old, requires frequent repairs, or uses outdated refrigerant, replacement is often more cost-effective in the long run due to improved energy efficiency and reliability. We can provide an honest assessment to help you decide.</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<!-- FAQ Item 4 -->\r\n<div class=\"bg-white rounded-lg shadow-md\">\r\n<h3 class=\"font-semibold text-lg\">Do you offer emergency AC repair services?</h3>\r\n&nbsp;\r\n<div class=\"accordion-content px-6 pb-6\">\r\n<p class=\"text-gray-600\">Yes, we understand that AC breakdowns can happen at any time. Atlas Aircon offers <strong>24/7 emergency AC repair services</strong> across Vadodara to ensure you get help right when you need it most.</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<!-- FAQ Item 5 -->\r\n<div class=\"bg-white rounded-lg shadow-md\">\r\n<h3 class=\"font-semibold text-lg\">What AC brands do you service?</h3>\r\n&nbsp;\r\n<div class=\"accordion-content px-6 pb-6\">\r\n<p class=\"text-gray-600\">Our expert technicians are trained to repair and service all major brands of central AC systems, including Daikin, Voltas, LG, Carrier, Trane, Mitsubishi, Blue Star, and more.</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<!-- FAQ Item 6 -->\r\n<div class=\"bg-white rounded-lg shadow-md\">\r\n<h3 class=\"font-semibold text-lg\">How often should I get my central AC serviced?</h3>\r\n&nbsp;\r\n<div class=\"accordion-content px-6 pb-6\">\r\n<p class=\"text-gray-600\">We recommend a comprehensive maintenance check-up at least once a year, preferably before the summer season begins. Regular maintenance improves efficiency, extends the lifespan of your unit, and helps prevent costly breakdowns.</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</section><!-- Contact and Conclusion Section -->\r\n\r\n<section id=\"contact\" class=\"py-16 bg-blue-800 text-white\">\r\n<div class=\"container mx-auto px-6 text-center\">\r\n<h2 class=\"text-4xl font-extrabold mb-4\">Ready for Uninterrupted Comfort?</h2>\r\n<p class=\"max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-8 text-blue-100\">Don&#8217;t let a faulty AC disrupt your life. Whether you need a new installation, a quick repair, or routine maintenance, Atlas Aircon is your go-to expert in Vadodara. Contact us today for a fast, friendly, and professional service experience.</p>\r\n<a class=\"bg-white text-blue-800 font-bold py-3 px-8 rounded-lg text-lg hover:bg-gray-200 transition-colors duration-300 shadow-lg inline-block mb-4 md:mb-0\" href=\"tel:+919825408593\">Call Us Now: +91 9825408593</a>\r\n<a rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ml-0 md:ml-4 bg-orange-500 text-white font-bold py-3 px-8 rounded-lg text-lg hover:bg-orange-600 transition-colors duration-300 shadow-lg inline-block\" href=\"https://atlasaircons.com/contact-us\">Request Service Online</a>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</section>&nbsp;\r\n\r\n<script>\r\n        // Accordion functionality for FAQ\r\n        const accordionToggles = document.querySelectorAll('.accordion-toggle');\r\n        accordionToggles.forEach(button => {\r\n            button.addEventListener('click', () => {\r\n                const content = button.nextElementSibling;\r\n                const icon = button.querySelector('svg');\r\n\r\n                if (content.style.maxHeight) {\r\n                    content.style.maxHeight = null;\r\n                    icon.style.transform = 'rotate(0deg)';\r\n                } else {\r\n                    // Close other open accordions\r\n                    document.querySelectorAll('.accordion-content').forEach(c => {\r\n                        if (c !== content) {\r\n                           c.style.maxHeight = null;\r\n                           c.previousElementSibling.querySelector('svg').style.transform = 'rotate(0deg)';\r\n                        }\r\n                    });\r\n                    \r\n                    content.style.maxHeight = content.scrollHeight + \"px\";\r\n                    icon.style.transform = 'rotate(180deg)';\r\n                }\r\n            });\r\n        });\r\n    </script>",
